# Accepted risks, reviewed on purpose. See README for details.

# State bucket uses AWS-managed encryption (SSE-S3). A customer-managed KMS key adds cost with no real gain here.
AWS-0132

# The ALB is meant to be public: it is the only entry point, protected by WAF.
AWS-0053

# No domain name, so no TLS certificate. HTTPS is a listed future improvement.
AWS-0054
